t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2bbac46 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"2bbac46\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-06dca71 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"06dca71\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 *\/\n.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-stacked .elementor-drop-cap{background-color:#69727d;color:#fff}.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-framed .elementor-drop-cap{color:#69727d;border:3px solid;background-color:transparent}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap{margin-top:8px}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap-letter{width:1em;height:1em}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap{float:left;text-align:center;line-height:1;font-size:50px}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap-letter{display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t<p>The membership of the Board of Trustees of the University is made up of a number of former Vice-Chancellors of top universities and other eminent and internationally distinguished personalities<br \/>comprising:<\/p><ul><li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><ul><li>Emeritus Prof. Ivan Addae-Mensah, Vice Chairman of the AIT Board of Trustees<\/li><\/ul><\/li><li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><ul><li>Dr. K. Y. Amoako, Former United Nations Under-Secretary-General and Executive Secretary of the United Nations Economic Commission for Africa, Vice Chairman<\/li><\/ul><\/li><\/ul><ul><li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><ul><li>Professor Samuel K. Adjepong. Former Vice Chancellor, University of Cape Coast, Member<\/li><\/ul><\/li><\/ul><ul><li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><ul><li>Dr. Grace Bediako, Former Government Statistician, Ghana Statistical Service, Member<\/li><\/ul><\/li><\/ul><ul><li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><ul><li>Professor Jophus Anamuah-Mensah, Former Vice Chancellor, University of Education, Winneba, Member<\/li><\/ul><\/li><\/ul><ul><li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><ul><li>Professor William Otoo Ellis, Former Vice Chancellor, Kwame Nkrumah University of Science and Technology (KNUST), Member<\/li><\/ul><\/li><\/ul><ul><li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><ul><li>Rev Ama Afo Blay, Former Director General, Ghana Education Service (GES), Member<\/li><\/ul><\/li><\/ul><ul><li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><ul><li>Professor Clement Dzidonu, President of AIT, Member<\/li><\/ul><\/li><\/ul><ul><li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><ul><li>Professor Emeritus Anuwar Ali, Former President and Vice-Chancellor, Open University, Malaysia; Former Vice Chancellor, National University of Malaysia, Member, National Higher Education Council, Malaysia, Member<\/li><\/ul><\/li><\/ul><ul><li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><ul><li>KS Yamoah, Managing Director, The Ghana Stock Exchange (GSE) Member<\/li><\/ul><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b469811 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"b469811\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 *\/\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"596\" src=\"https:\/\/ait.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/AIT-Board-of-Trustees-1024x596.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-382\" alt=\"AIT Board of Trustees\" srcset=\"https:\/\/ait.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/AIT-Board-of-Trustees-1024x596.png 1024w, https:\/\/ait.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/AIT-Board-of-Trustees-300x175.png 300w, https:\/\/ait.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/AIT-Board-of-Trustees-768x447.png 768w, https:\/\/ait.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/AIT-Board-of-Trustees.png 1056w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-8558d49 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"8558d49\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-c3e679f\" data-id=\"c3e679f\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-7178466 elementor-section-content-middle elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"7178466\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-3dc051b\" data-id=\"3dc051b\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-500c45c elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"500c45c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-b01083b\" data-id=\"b01083b\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ca54d85 envato-kit-138-bracket elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ca54d85\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">university advisory council<\/h3>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1b003c7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1b003c7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"article\">The University Advisory Council (UAC) whose membership is made up of distinguish personalities from business, public sector, labour, academia and the professions is an integral part of the University&#8217;s leadership and governance structure.<br \/>Its principal role is to assist the Board of Trustees, the President and other Principal Officers and key constituent bodies of the University in an advisory capacity on matters relating to: the university&#8217;s strategic, operational and financial direction; its academic, professional and research programs and on faculty and students issues.<\/p><p>Members of the University Advisory Council:<\/p><p><b>Professor E.H.K. Akaho<\/b><br \/>Director General, Ghana Atomic Energy Commission (GAEC)<\/p><p><b>Professor Walter Alhassan<\/b><br \/>Former Director General, Council for Scientific and Industrial Research (CSIR) &amp; Chairman, Meridian University College Council<\/p><p><b>Mr. Kwami Adu-Amankwah<\/b><br \/>General Secretary, Trade Union Congress (TUC)<\/p><p><b>Alhaji Hamidu Ibrahim Baryeh<\/b><br \/>Former Executive Secretary, Lands Commission<\/p><p><b>Mrs. Josephine Okutu<\/b><br \/>National President, Charterd Institute of Marketing Ghana (CIMG)<\/p><p><b>Mr. Saied Fakhry<\/b><br \/>Chairman, Interplast Limited<\/p><p><b>Prof Essel Ben Hagan<\/b><br \/>Former President, Ghana Institution of Engineers (GHiE)<\/p><p><b>Mrs. Leticia Osafo Addo<\/b><br \/>Vice President, Association of Ghana Industries (AGI)<\/p><p><b>Dr. Osei Boeh Ocansey<\/b><br \/>Executive Director, Private Enterprise Foundation (PEF)<\/p><p><b>Mr. Frank Ocran<\/b><br \/>Former Executive Chairman, State Enterprises Commission (SEC)<\/p><p><b>Professor Paa-Bekoe Welbeck<\/b><br \/>Former Vice President, Advancement and Innovations, AIT and Former Vice President for Technology, Virginia Union University, USA<\/p><p><b>Dr. Aido Opoku-Mensah<\/b><br \/>Director, ICT and Science &amp; Technology Division, United Nations Economic Commission for Africa (UNECA)<\/p><p><b>Professor Benjamin Aggrey-Ntim<\/b><br \/>Former Minister of Communications, Ghana<\/p><p><b>Nii Adotey Obour<\/b><\/p><p><b>Prof. D.K Yeboah-Amankwah<\/b><\/p><p>Dean of Graduate Studies<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>board of trustees The membership of the Board of Trustees of the University is made up of a number of [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"site-sidebar-layout":"no-sidebar","site-content-layout":"","ast-site-content-layout":"full-width-container","site-content-style":"default","site-sid